<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Capacuan 5.1816 ha block - anchor check</name><Placemark><name>A - as written (122 42' 30"-37.5")</name><description>Corners exactly as written in Kapasyahan 18 s-2021 / 64 s-2024 and the 2026 refiling. About 3.1 km west of the Capacuan reference point.</description><Style><LineStyle><color>ff0000ff</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>330000ff</color></PolyStyle></Style><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>122.708333,14.252083,0 122.708333,14.254167,0 122.710417,14.254167,0 122.710417,14.252083,0 122.708333,14.252083,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark><Placemark><name>B - hypothesis: 44' not 42' (122 44' 30"-37.5")</name><description>UNVERIFIED hypothesis: longitude minutes miscopied 42 for 44. Same latitudes. Lands about 0.6 km from the Capacuan reference point. Check against the plant GPS.</description><Style><LineStyle><color>ff00ffff</color><width>3</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>3300ffff</color></PolyStyle></Style><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>122.741667,14.252083,0 122.741667,14.254167,0 122.743750,14.254167,0 122.743750,14.252083,0 122.741667,14.252083,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark><Placemark><name>Capacuan reference point (PhilAtlas)</name><Point><coordinates>122.7379,14.2498,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
